  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-toolbox",
      "title": {
        "en": "YuFeng · Windows Toolbox",
        "zh": "御风 · Windows 工具箱"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "One tool call returns a full environment snapshot (OS, shells, toolchain versions, CPU/memory/GPU, disks, code page, privileges, mirrors, network matrix and fallbacks), refreshed every 60 s with a sample timestamp, so the agent never has to probe one command at a time. Plus system-wide selection translation via a global hotkey, driving Win32 through DSH's bundled koffi FFI: no separate executable, no Python.",
        "zh": "一条工具调用返回完整环境快照（系统 / shell / 工具链版本 / CPU·内存·GPU / 磁盘 / 代码页 / 权限 / 镜像源 / 网络矩阵与降级对策），每 60 秒刷新并带采样时间戳，Agent 不必逐条命令试探。另有系统级划词转译：全局热键，通过 DSH 自带的 koffi（FFI）直调 Win32，无需独立 exe、无需 Python。"
      },
